  unitName: Boltdrive Zedus
  unitId: 840146
  unitNumber: 8066
  description: Zedus was the first demi-god created by the old gods in an attempt
    to establish a utopian land. Birthed from a ravaging lightning storm, he wielded
    the power of electric carnage and could strike down any foe within moments. With
    his exceptional leadership skills, he guided the rest of the demi-gods toward
    achieving new milestones of civilization. Seeing potential in the talented tinkerer
    Gazia, Zedus assigned him to technological research for the development of Athensphere.
    However, as time went by, Gazia experimented with forbidden technology that disrupted
    the balance of nature. Fearing that it would become uncontrollable, Zedus ordered
    him to shut down his research. Gazia created an iron army before Zedus could
    stop him, starting the augmentation wars which led to the old gods forsaking
    the once utopian lands of Athensphere. Desperate to regain control, Zedus made
    a hard decision to use the enemy's power against itself. Tearing apart a mighty
    Grievesnare, he armed himself with all the power he could salvage and control...
  summonDesc: When you are desperate and jaded, anything goes. I will take back Athensphere!
  fusionDesc: This power of mine will be a temporary strength for my victory!
  evoDesc: So this is the power Gazia dreams of..
  element: 4
  rarity: 5
